  "summary": "QBOT is a modular trojan that uses complex command lines with curl.exe and regsvr32.exe for initial execution, followed by injection into explorer.exe. It achieves persistence via randomly named registry run keys and escalates privileges by creating a scheduled task to run as SYSTEM. The malware decrypts a configuration containing C2 IP addresses and evades defenses by checking for analysis tools.",
